<title>FINLAND: Suspended Neste to issue statement 1200GMT.</title>
<headline>Suspended Neste to issue statement 1200GMT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-controlled oil, chemicals and energy group Neste Oy will release a statement at 1500 local time/1200 GMT, a company spokeswoman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>She declined comment when asked about the content of the statement, but said it was related to the suspension of the company's share on the Helsinki stock exchange.</p>
<p>The bourse said trade in Neste shares had been suspended at the company's own request.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
